{
  "name": "Flameblast Oil Grenade Gemling Build Gui - Mapping",
  "author": "Cptn Garbage",
  "link": "https://maxroll.gg/poe2/planner/nwgl0t0i",
  "description": "<s>{- Level up in the Campaign by blowing up packs of monsters with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Explosive Grenade} and commanding a full screen arrow barrage with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Supporting Fire}.\r\n- At level 52, create a huge ignite with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Flameblast}, which sets ablaze the Oil Ground from <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Oil Grenade}, creating a massively damaging ignited ground.\r\n- Simply continue spamming <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Oil Grenade} to spread the ignited ground throughout the whole map, keeping the initial ignite instance alive as long as it has more Oil to burn.\r\n- Stay alive thanks to enormous monster movement speed slows from <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Blasphemy}+<rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Temporal Chains}, <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Oil Grenade} slows, over 25,000 Armour with over 100% Armour Applies to Elemental Damage.\r\n- Scale into a mobile clearspeed machine with absurd single target and constant, screen wide and extremely damaging ignited ground.\r\n- Powernap or watch TikTok on your second monitor during Rituals and Simulacrums.}",
  "ascendancy": "Mercenary3",
